<title>USA: United Foods Inc Q1 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>United Foods Inc Q1 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BELLS, Tenn. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						     For The Three Months</p>
<p>							    Ended May 31,</p>
<p>							    1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					    $ 46,963  $ 48,708</p>
<p>  Miscellaneous Income (Expense) - Net	     41	 403</p>
<p> Net Income						 400	  98</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share of Common Stock And</p>
<p>  Common Stock Share Equivalents		    .04	 .01</p>
<p>NOTE: Miscellaneous Income for the three months ended May 31, 1996 includes the recognition of a claim in the amount of $167,000 and $212,000 to restore the carrying value of property held for disposal to its original cost, based on its current estimated fair value.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
